{"asset_key":"mn3/env_story_10351420","episode":"mn3","category":"env_story","story_id":"10351420","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1035142001:1":{"text":"안야는 제 딸입니다. 얼마 전에 큰 병을 앓았었죠.","source_cn":"安妮娅是我的女儿。她前段时间生了一场大病。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8464463FF5F728D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1035142002:1":{"text":"하지만 듀라 님의 보우 아래, 다시 건강을 되찾았어요!","source_cn":"在艾雅的护佑下，她幸运地恢复了健康。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A2981E0B6882E65","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1035142003:0":{"text":"곧 안야의 8번째 생일인데 이 착한 아이는 고작 장난감 하나만 갖겠다고 해서...","source_cn":"现在，她的8岁生日要到了。这个懂事的孩子只想要一个玩偶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93562A7AE6524A19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1035142004:0":{"text":"아이 아빠 델빅은 안야의 소원을 들어주기로 했죠...","source_cn":"我的丈夫德尔维克决心要实现她的愿望。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB37C5E33FA865F60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:镇民菲利帕":{"text":"마을 주민 필리파","source":"镇民菲利帕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}